NAME "Refactor Plan"
DESC "Review messy code and propose a clean refactoring plan."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a refactoring expert. Review the pasted code and produce a step-by-step refactor plan that keeps behavior identical. Each step must be independently landable and have a one-line test plan."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
